fic Creative Tonie. The Household Owner can manage the permissions using the ton...\n\n### How do I change the name of my Household?\n\nHad a change of heart or maybe just want to freshen things up a bit by changing the name of your Household? Not to worry, it's easy to do using my.tonies.com! Follow the steps below and you will be all set in no time! Changing the name of your Household using my.tonies.com: Login to your account at ...\n\n### How do I remove a Toniebox 1 from my Household?\n\nReturning or no longer have a Toniebox 1 and want to remove it from your Household? This can be done using either the tonies app or on my.tonies.com. How to remove a Toniebox 1 from your Household: Using the tonies app Open the tonies app and tap the icon in the bottom right hand corner titled 'Coll...\n\n### I'm having trouble logging in to my account\n\nOh no! There's actually a couple of different reasons why you might be running into some trouble when trying to log in. Let's go through the possible reasons why and what we can do to fix it. The password was entered incorrectly The first thing to check is to make sure you have indeed entered your a...\n\n### How do I delete my Household?\n\nIf you need to delete your Household for any reason, it's important to know that this process will also permanently delete all data, including any recordings that are on Creative Tonies in your Household. If you would like to proceed with deleting your Household, follow the steps below. How to delet...--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTonieplay and How It Works | tonies® (https://us.tonies.com/pages/tonieplay)\nciteturn783search5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; ## Unlock a world of games, quizzes, challenges, and adventures with Tonieplay for Toniebox 2, all in a safe, screen-free environment with no ads. ... Turn it.Press it.\n\n# Explore Tonieplay\n\nA screen-free world of interactive stories and games, only on Toniebox 2.\n\nShop Now Start Your Order\n\n## Tonieplay Games & Controller\n\n[Input] Add [Button: Pre-Order ] [Button: Out of Stock ] [Button: Notify Me ]\n\nInteractive Play\n\n## Unlock a world of games, quizzes, challenges, and adventures with Tonieplay for Toniebox 2, all in a safe, screen-free environment with no ads.\n\nImmersive Storytelling\n\n## Dive into engaging, interactive stories where kids can shape their own story, make choices, and enhance strategic thinking skills.\n\nSolo or Group Play\n\n## Tonieplay offers flexible gameplay, whether kids are playing on their own or challenging friends for shared fun and learning.\n\n## Why They'll Love Tonieplay\n\n### Safe, screen-free gaming\n\nInteractive games, quizzes and adventures in a safe gaming environment with no screens or ads.\n\n### Helps kid thrive\n\nGames flex problem-solving and critical thinking skills, giving kids confidence in the real world.\n\n### Fun for the whole family\n\nGo solo or team up for or a quiz or go on an awesome adventure with friends and family.\n\n### Increase attention span\n\nEngaging games and stories help enhance kids’ focus and improve concentration\n\n### Improve listening comprehension\n\nGames and stories are designed to cultivate active listening skills.\n\n### Improve coordination\n\nGame play helps boost hand-eye coordination and fine motor abilities.\n\n### Encourage self belief\n\nGames help to increase self-efficacy, making kids more likely to set and achieve goals.\n\n### Support great decision making\n\nKids exercise their decision-making skills through games that invite participation.\n\n## How to Use Tonieplay\n\n### This is a Toniebox 2\n\nKid-friendly design and intuitive play controls make it easy for them to take control of their listening.\n\nImage: top view of a red Toniebox 2 showcasing the new dynamic light ring\n\n### This is a Tonieplay game\n\nKids lead the way in quests, trivia games and interactive stories that put them in charge of the twists and turns.\n\nImage: Placing PAW Patrol Tonieplay game onto a Toniebox 2\n\n### This is a Tonieplay Controller\n\nTurn it. Press it. Play it. The Controller works with every Tonieplay game – it’s how kids jump into the action.\n\nImage: Placing Tonieplay Controller onto the Toniebox 2 to play the PAW Patrol Tonieplay game\n\n### This is the Dynamic Light Ring\n\nThe Light Ring glows in rainbow colors when Tonies are playing, and gives helpful light cues to guide kids through the Tonieplay games.\n\nImage: PAW Patrol Tonieplay Game and Controller on red Toniebox 2\n\n### This is the future of play\n\nPut a Tonieplay Disc on the Toniebox 2, add the Controller and they're ready for hours of screen-free gaming.\n\n#### FAQs\n\n## Tonieplay Questions & Answers\n\n##### What do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game?\n\nTo play a Tonieplay Game you’ll need a Toniebox 2 and a Tonieplay Controller. If it’s the first time the game is being played you’ll also need a WiFi connection, but after this it will work offline too.\n\n##### Is Tonieplay compatible with Toniebox 1?\n\nNo, because of the tech advancements of Tonieplay it will only work on Toniebox 2.\n\n##### What aged children is Tonieplay suitable for?\n\nThere are Tonieplay games for everyone from 3 years and up, with more coming all the time.\n\n##### How much help will my child need with playing a Tonieplay game?\n\nTonieplay Games are designed to be easy to follow, but we’ve also included a written manual in every box for those who prefer to read up first. Younger players may need a little support at the beginning – but they’ll be playing independently in no time.\n\n##### Are Tonieplay games multiplayer?\n\nAll our Tonieplay Games are designed for solo play but can also be enjoyed together.\n\n##### How do Tonieplay games appear in the app?\n\nOnce you’ve loaded a Tonieplay Game on the Toniebox 2 you’ll be able to see it in your collection section of the app, just like Tonies\n\n##### Can I skip past the intro to the Tonieplay game?\n\nYep. Most games include a skip feature so you can move forward or back through the story. Intros are usually skippable, but some moments – like answering a quiz question or making a choice in an interactive story – can’t be replayed right away.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nManaging Your Household – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/sections/29036388191506-Managing-Your-Household)\nciteturn783search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; ### How do I remove a Toniebox from my Household? ... ### How do I delete my Household?\n\n# Managing Your Household\n\n### Popular Articles\n\n## Articles\n\n7 articles\n\n### How to create a my.tonies account\n\n### How do I invite other members into my Household?\n\nWant to allow others into your Household to record messages onto your Creative Tonies? This is one of the best features about Creative Tonies! All that is required for the other members to have is a free my.tonies.com account. Follow these steps and you will be good to go in no time! Want to see tha...\n\n### How do I manage Household members permissions?\n\nThe Household Owner can always manage and change the permissions of all other Household members. If a member does not see a Creative Tonie in their account, they may not have been given permission to view/edit that specific Creative Tonie. The Household Owner can manage the permissions using the ton...\n\n### How do I change the name of my Household?\n\nHad a change of heart or maybe just want to freshen things up a bit by changing the name of your Household? Not to worry, it's easy to do using my.tonies.com! Follow the steps below and you will be all set in no time! Changing the name of your Household using my.tonies.com: Login to your account at ...\n\n### How do I remove a Toniebox from my Household?\n\nReturning or no longer have a Toniebox and want to remove it from your Household? This can be done using either the tonies® app or on my.tonies.com. How to remove a Toniebox from your Household: Using the original tonies® app Open the tonies® app and tap the 'Tonieboxes' tab at the bottom of the scr...\n\n### I'm having trouble logging in to my account\n\nOh no! There's actually a couple of different reasons why you might be running into some trouble when trying to log in. Let's go through the possible reasons why and what we can do to fix it. The password was entered incorrectly The first thing to check is to make sure you have indeed entered your a...\n\n### How do I delete my Household?\n\nIf you need to delete your Household for any reason, it's important to know that this process will also permanently delete all data, including any recordings that are on Creative Tonies in your Household. If you would like to proceed with deleting your Household, follow the steps below. How to delet...--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHow do I gift a Toniebox? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29036584929682-How-do-I-gift-a-Toniebox)\nciteturn783search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; For steps walking through this process, take a look at our support article here: How do I transfer ownership of my Household?\n\n# How do I gift a Toniebox?\n\nWant to spread the joy of tonies®️ and gift a Toniebox 1 or 2? That's great! Here are our recommendations when gifting to ensure a smooth experience:\n\n  * If you or someone in your same household is going to be the primary user of the Toniebox 1 or 2: We recommend walking through the initial Toniebox set up process before giving the Toniebox to the gift recipient. This will ensure that the Toniebox is fully set up, ready to go, and will be able to play as soon as the recipient unwraps their new gift! \n    * For Toniebox 1: How do I set up my Toniebox 1?\n    * For Toniebox 2: How do I set up my Toniebox 2?\n \n  * If you are gifting the Toniebox 1 or 2 to someone outside of your household: We recommend sending the Toniebox and any Tonies to the gift recipient to have them complete the setup process. We recommend this because in order to set up a Toniebox, you will need a Tonie-Account. When the Toniebox is set up, a Household will also be automatically created under the Tonie-Account that was originally used to set it up. If you set up the Toniebox under your account, you will then be the owner of the Household and Toniebox, instead of the gift recipient. Having the gift recipient complete the set up process will also ensure that they are connected to their personally available Wi-Fi network for any future downloads.\nHowever, if you would still prefer to walkthrough the Toniebox set up process before giving the Toniebox to the gift recipient, there is a process to transfer ownership of your Household to another user. For steps walking through this process, take a look at our support article here: How do I transfer ownership of my Household?\n \n\nIf you have any other questions about gifting the Toniebox 1 or 2, send us a message and we will be there to help!--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAccount – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/sections/29036387798930-Account)\nciteturn783search8 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; Creating a my.tonies account is quick and easy: Head to the official tonies® app or my.tonies.com Fill in the required fields on the registration form Optionally, add a few personal details to make your welcome experience more personalised Click the red ‘create my account’ button at the bottom of th... ... ### How do I remove a Toniebox from my Household? ... ### How do I delete my Household?\n\n# Account\n\n### Topics\n\nManaging Your Household Customisation All Other Articles\n\n## Managing Your Household\n\n7 articles\n\n### How to create a my.tonies account\n\nCreating a my.tonies account is quick and easy: Head to the official tonies® app or my.tonies.com Fill in the required fields on the registration form Optionally, add a few personal details to make your welcome experience more personalised Click the red ‘create my account’ button at the bottom of th...\n\n### How do I invite other members into my Household?\n\nWant to allow others into your Household to record messages onto your Creative Tonies? This is one of the best features about Creative Tonies! All that is required for the other members to have is a free my.tonies.com account. Follow these steps and you will be good to go in no time! Want to see tha...\n\nRead Article →\n\n### How do I manage Household members permissions?\n\nThe Household Owner can always manage and change the permissions of all other Household members. If a member does not see a Creative Tonie in their account, they may not have been given permission to view/edit that specific Creative Tonie. The Household Owner can manage the permissions using the ton...\n\n### How do I change the name of my Household?\n\nHad a change of heart or maybe just want to freshen things up a bit by changing the name of your Household? Not to worry, it's easy to do using my.tonies.com! Follow the steps below and you will be all set in no time! Changing the name of your Household using my.tonies.com: Login to your account at ...\n\n### How do I remove a Toniebox from my Household?\n\nReturning or no longer have a Toniebox and want to remove it from your Household? This can be done using either the tonies® app or on my.tonies.com. How to remove a Toniebox from your Household: Using the original tonies® app Open the tonies® app and tap the 'Tonieboxes' tab at the bottom of the scr...\n\nRead Article →\n\n### I'm having trouble logging in to my account\n\nOh no! There's actually a couple of different reasons why you might be running into some trouble when trying to log in. Let's go through the possible reasons why and what we can do to fix it. The password was entered incorrectly The first thing to check is to make sure you have indeed entered your a...\n\n### How do I delete my Household?\n\nIf you need to delete your Household for any reason, it's important to know that this process will also permanently delete all data, including any recordings that are on Creative Tonies in your Household. If you would like to proceed with deleting your Household, follow the steps below. How to delet...\n\n## Customisation\n\n1 articles\n\n### Change your personal data\n\nRead Article →\n\n## All Other Articles\n\n1 articles\n\n### tonies® Account - Google Sign In\n\nRead Article →--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHow do I start a return? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-150/articles/29036546250642-How-do-I-start-a-return)\nciteturn783search9 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Make sure to follow through the processes listed in the articles below to reset the Toniebox to factory settings and choose to either delete your Household or just remove the Toniebox from your Household before initiating your return: ...   * How do I delete my Household?\n\n# How do I start a return?\n\nItems purchased from our website can be returned to us within 30 days of receipt of the products, provided they are complete and in an unused and undamaged condition. An exchange for another item is not possible. If you return products in accordance with this return policy, we will refund your purchase price, but not the shipping costs of your original purchase.\n\nTo do this, proceed as follows:\n\n  1.  Register your return via our returns portal.\nPlease make sure that you enter the email address that was used to place the order and make sure that it is written correctly (in lower and upper case). \n  2. As soon as you have completed the returns form, you will receive a prepaid return label for returns from our European delivery countries.\n  3. This will be sent to you by email. Hand the parcel over to the shipping service provider (DHL) and keep the proof the postage in a safe place.\n\nThe credit amount will be refunded to you within 10 working days of receipt of the return using the payment method used for the order.\n\nAs soon as we have received and processed your parcel, we will confirm receipt by email. You will receive a separate email for each return.\n\nA direct exchange or claim is not possible.\n\nIn the event of a dispute, please contact our support team and share the order number with us.\n\nPlease note: Bundles can only be returned in full. Partial returns/refunds are not possible.\n\nReturning a Toniebox? Make sure to follow through the processes listed in the articles below to reset the Toniebox to factory settings and choose to either delete your Household or just remove the Toniebox from your Household before initiating your return:\n\n  * How do I reset the Toniebox to factory settings?\n  * How do I delete my Household?\n  * How do I remove a Toniebox from my Household?--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Toniebox is already in another Household – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-150/articles/29036605797010-The-Toniebox-is-already-in-another-Household)\nciteturn783search10 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; Follow our article on transferring ownership of a Household here: How do I transfer ownership of my Household? ... For detailed instructions walking through this connection process, take a look at our support article here: How do I connect my Toniebox to a different Wi-Fi network?\n\n# The Toniebox is already in another Household\n\nYou want to set up your Toniebox, but get a message saying your Toniebox is already in another Household? First, double-check if this Toniebox was a gift. The gifter may have already set up the Toniebox and will just need to transfer ownership to you. Follow our article on transferring ownership of a Household here: How do I transfer ownership of my Household?\n\n \n\nIf the Toniebox was not a gift, follow the steps below to get up and running! Please note that you can use either my.tonies.com or the mytonies app to complete this process.\n\nUsing my.tonies.com\n\n  1. Reset the Toniebox to factory settings by following these steps:\n     * Place the Toniebox on top of the charging station and ensure the power is turned on.\n     * Turn the Toniebox and charger upside-down so the ears are facing the floor.\n     * While upside down, pinch and hold both Toniebox ears for about 10 seconds until you hear an audio tone and the Toniebox turns off.\nImage: IMG_0585.PNGImage: IMG_0586.PNG\n  \n  7. Once your Toniebox has been located, you will see a 'Set Up Accessory' window at the bottom of the screen, and it will ask you to pair your Toniebox with the mytonies app and your smartphone. Once prompted, simply tap 'Set Up' at the bottom. \nImage: IMG_0587.PNG\n  \n  8. After the Toniebox has completed pairing, you will see a 'Finish Setup in App' screen at the bottom. To finalize the setup process, tap on the 'Continue in App' button. \nImage: IMG_0588.PNG\n  \n  9. Wait until the 'Loading Toniebox information' step is completed and has a green checkmark next to it, then tap on 'Continue'. \nImage: IMG_0589.PNGImage: IMG_0590.PNG\n  \n  10. If the Toniebox is already setup in a different Household, you will be prompted to either move the Toniebox to your new Household or just connect to a new WiFi network and keep the Toniebox in it's original Household. If you would like to move the Toniebox to your new Household, tap on 'Setup and move to my household' and continue to the next step.\n\nUsing the mytonies app on an Android smartphone\n\n  1. Open the mytonies app and tap the icon in the bottom right hand corner titled 'Collection'.\nImage: Step_1.jpg\n  \n  2. Scroll down and tap the red plus (+) sign next to 'Toniebox'\nImage: Step_2.jpg\n  \n  3. Tap 'Start Setup Process' at the bottom of the screen to start the setup process.\nImage: 1.jpg\n  \n  4. Enter your Toniebox ID. This is the 8 digit ID that can be found on the bottom of your Toniebox. Make sure the Toniebox is not on the charger or you will not be able to see the Toniebox ID. Once you have entered your Toniebox ID, tap 'Continue'.\nImage: 3.jpg\n  \n  5. If the Toniebox is already setup in a different Household, you will be prompted to either move the Toniebox to your new Household or just connect to a new WiFi network and keep the Toniebox in it's original Household. If you would like to move the Toniebox to your new Household, tap on 'Setup and move to my household' and continue to the next step.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Toniebox 1 is already in another Household – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29036605797010-The-Toniebox-1-is-already-in-another-Household)\nciteturn783search11 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; Follow our article on transferring ownership of a Household here: How do I transfer ownership of my Household? ... For detailed instructions walking through this connection process, take a look at our support article here: How do I connect my Toniebox 1 to a different Wi-Fi network?\n\n# The Toniebox 1 is already in another Household\n\nYou want to set up your Toniebox 1, but get a message saying your Toniebox 1 is already in another Household? First, double-check if this Toniebox 1 was a gift. The gifter may have already set up the Toniebox 1 and will just need to transfer ownership to you. Follow our article on transferring ownership of a Household here: How do I transfer ownership of my Household?\n\nIf the Toniebox 1 was not a gift, follow the steps below to get up and running! Please note that you can use either my.tonies.com or the tonies app to complete this process.\n\nUsing my.tonies.com\n\n  1. Reset the Toniebox 1 to factory settings by following these steps:\n     * Place the Toniebox 1 on top of the charging station and ensure the power is turned on.\n     * Turn the Toniebox 1 and charger upside-down so the ears are facing the floor.\n     * While upside down, pinch and hold both Toniebox 1 ears for about 10 seconds until you hear an audio tone and the Toniebox 1 turns off.\n\nUsing the tonies app on an Android smartphone\n\n  1. Open the tonies app and tap the icon in the bottom right hand corner titled 'Collection'.\nImage: Step_1.jpg\n \n  2. Scroll down and tap the red plus (+) sign next to 'Toniebox'\nImage: Step_2.jpg\n \n  3. Tap 'Start Setup Process' at the bottom of the screen to start the setup process.\nImage: 1.jpg\n \n  4. Enter your Toniebox 1 ID. This is the 8 digit ID that can be found on the bottom of your Toniebox 1. Make sure the Toniebox 1 is not on the charger or you will not be able to see the Toniebox 1 ID. Once you have entered your Toniebox 1 ID, tap 'Continue'.\nImage: 3.jpg\n \n  5. If the Toniebox 1 is already setup in a different Household, you will be prompted to either move the Toniebox 1 to your new Household or just connect to a new WiFi network and keep the Toniebox 1 in it's original Household. If you would like to move the Toniebox 1 to your new Household, tap on 'Setup and move to my household' and continue to the next step.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nToniebox 2 – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/sections/29036371272594-Toniebox-2)\nciteturn783view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/sections/29036371272594-Toniebox-2\",\"lineno\":20}); Total lines: 201\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United States)\nL5: \nL6: # Toniebox 2\nL7: \nL8: ### Popular Articles\nL9: \nL10: Toniebox 2\nL11: \nL12: Browse Topic\nL13: \nL14: Quick Search\nL15: \nL16: [Input: Search for articles, guides, and help...]\nL17: \nL18: ### Topics\nL19: \nL20: 【2†Product Information